Ground Unit Roles
Infantry — Patrol, Rescue, Scout

Light Vehicles — Mule, Rover

Medium Armor — Bulldog, Forge

Heavy Armor — Hammer, Crusher

Specialists — Ironwalker (engineer), Sentinel (AA)

Logistics Units — Hauler

Ground Unit AI Behaviors
Seek cover

Avoid suppression zones

Anchor firing lines

Flank entrenched enemies

Form breach stacks

Regroup after losses

Ground units are the most tactically diverse category.

